<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>iamatomiccc</Major>
    <Description>Sniper macro keyran file is a good macro for any sniper rifle you just have to set it up in either left or right mouse click to automatically quick scope, and fire, and doing a QUICK CHANGE!! just press the mouse thoroughly and remember to not do it too fast as it will not function well. THIS MACRO IS ONLY FOR THE PLAYERS WITH 50% QUICK CHANGE AND MUCH BETTER WITH A SKULL RED BERET!! I WILL POST A YOUTUBE TUTORIAL SOON WITH THIS GOOD KEYRAN MACRO THANKSS!!https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PT6IYlsoOTQ</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>RightDown 1
Delay 30 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 20 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyDown 32 1
Delay 18 ms
KeyDown 20 1
Delay 19 ms
KeyDown 30 1
Delay 17 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Point blank</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>